            <ArticleTitle>Does the method of injection alter the outcome of epidural injections?</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>507-10</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A pilot study involving 44 patients with low back and leg pain was performed to compare the relative efficacy of epidural caudal and lumbar injections.</AbstractText>
